OL,3,GNEWSACamilla admits it was 'difficult'
OL,4,Ato keep King's cancer diagnosis a
OL,5,Asecret
OL,6,
OL,7,FQueen Camilla has spoken for the first
OL,8,Ftime about King Charles III's cancer
OL,9,Fdiagnosis, describing the pressure of
OL,10,Fkeeping it secret in the early stages
OL,11,Fof treatment.
OL,13,FIn a video to mark the 30th anniversary
OL,14,Fof Maggie's cancer charity, the Queen,
OL,15,Fwho is president of the charity,
OL,16,Frecalls how "difficult" it was to avoid
OL,17,Fdiscussing her husband's treatment
OL,18,Fwhile on an official engagement with
OL,19,Fcancer patients and their families.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
