OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACamilla admits it was 'difficult'
OL,4,Ato keep King's cancer diagnosis a
OL,5,Asecret
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn January 2024, the Queen opened a new
OL,8,FMaggie's cancer support centre at the
OL,9,FRoyal Free Hospital in London.
OL,11,FShe had just found out that the King
OL,12,Fhad cancer and would need treatment but
OL,13,Fhad to hold back from telling anyone as
OL,14,Fthe official announcement had not been
OL,15,Fmade public.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
